# Admin UI — mobile-first (tenant `apps/admin`)

Any UI change in `apps/admin` is **mobile-first**. Desktop (≥960 / `mdAndUp`) may keep tables and permanent drawer; phone must be fast, tappable, and complete.

## Shell

- Mobile: **bottom nav** (Розмови · Замовлення · Дашборд · Ще) + temporary drawer for the rest.
- Desktop: permanent sidebar (unchanged).
- Do **not** add a nav item only to the long drawer without deciding bottom-nav vs «Ще».
- Chat-like routes set `meta.hideBottomNav: true`: `conversation-detail`, `teach`, `sandbox`, `insights` (and login).
- App bar title = `route.meta.title` (section name), not only brand.
- Content that shares the screen with bottom nav uses `.bottom-nav-pad` (or shell padding).

## Touch & density

- Min tap target **44×44** (`--tap-min`). Nav list items / icon buttons on mobile must meet this.
- On mobile: form fields and primary actions use `density="comfortable"` (via `useTouchDensity()`), not `compact`.
- Compact density is OK for dense **desktop** tables only.
- Respect `env(safe-area-inset-*)` for bottom bars, chat inputs, sticky CTAs.

## Lists & tables

- **Cards on mobile** (`.mobile-list-card` / `MobileListCard` / `ResponsiveDataList` `#cards`).
- Tables only on `mdAndUp` or explicitly desktop-only — never rely on horizontal scroll as the main mobile UX.
- Prefer shared components: `PageHeader`, `MobileListCard`, `ResponsiveDataList`, `StickyActionBar`.

## Dialogs & actions

- Mobile dialogs: fullscreen or bottom-sheet; primary CTA full-width in footer (`.sticky-action-bar` / `dialog-actions-stack`).
- Action rows must wrap; no single-line button strips that overflow the viewport.
- No hover-only affordances for critical actions.

## CSS tokens / classes

| Token / class | Use |
|---------------|-----|
| `--bottom-nav-height`, `--tap-min`, `--page-pad` | Shell spacing |
| `.bottom-nav-pad` | Main content offset above bottom nav |
| `.mobile-list-card` | List row card |
| `.sticky-action-bar` | Fixed/sticky CTA + safe-area |
| `.page-shell` | Optional page root flex column |

Styles live in `apps/admin/src/styles/global.css` and `mobile-shell.css`. Chat helpers: `mobile-agent-ui.css`.

## Forbidden

- Fixed `min-width` / column widths that exceed the viewport on phones without a card alternative.
- Global switch of all inputs to `compact` on touch devices.
- Inventing a second nav system that ignores bottom nav + drawer.

## Pre-merge checklist (admin UI)

1. ≤390px width: no horizontal shell overflow; bottom nav 4 items visible (unless `hideBottomNav`).
2. List screens: usable without table horizontal scroll.
3. Chat/detail: bottom nav hidden; input above home indicator.
4. Primary actions ≥44px tap; fields comfortable on mobile.
5. Desktop (≥960): sidebar + tables still work.
